{"annotations":{"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Pass an absolute path. Read an OPML, FreeMind, Freeplane, Markdown outline, Yuque Lakeboard, XMind (Zen or XMind 8), MindManager, iThoughts, SimpleMind, or CSV outline (.opml, .mm, .md, .markdown, .lakeboard, .xmind, .mmap, .itmz, .smmx, .csv) from a local path. All sheets are included (each under its sheet title); pass sheet (1-based index or title) to read one. Large maps are cut at maxNodes (default 2000) and flagged as truncated. format \"md\" = nested Markdown list, \"json\" = topic tree, \"outline\" = compact indented text. losses lists structural omissions; the same sentences are appended to warnings. Read-only.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"format":{"default":"md","enum":["md","json","outline"],"type":"string"},"maxDepth":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"maxNodes":{"maximum":50000,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"path":{"description":"Absolute path to a mind map (.opml, .mm, .md, .markdown, .lakeboard, .xmind, .mmap, .itmz, .smmx, .csv)","type":"string"},"sheet":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"minimum":1,"type":"integer"}]}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"},"name":"convert","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"file":{"type":"string"},"format":{"enum":["md","json","outline"],"type":"string"},"losses":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"code":{"enum":["relationship","summary","encrypted","internal-link","rich-note"],"type":"string"},"count":{"exclusiveMinimum":0,"type":"integer"}},"required":["code","count"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"maxDepth":{"type":"integer"},"nodeCount":{"type":"integer"},"schemaVersion":{"const":1,"type":"number"},"selectedSheet":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"index":{"type":"integer"},"title":{"type":"string"}},"required":["index","t